{"type":"message","id":"ea1b77be","parentId":"886f0cd0","timestamp":"2026-06-03T13:18:56.227Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_ts_AY89a1_0kg5fHsfx-dVhYeJ1r3IjsKmFaA5pTm46Rrly32d8Ppkpea8JJW5tLylaCC-OOQAYOSNkMq1Jye-oyHqds-di4dIHujKPMq52RRGeukGXVDp1ata8kBPrJC063Dy0_M1NvmUrLeeC-nWwaLXtJv5AfqAd-lGRWG3VFehBJu9ps_lLisGrXgBj-Yw5QPrERYzkRFU-p7ZlFvLhiec9d86V3m6-gYeg8ddzNXkAZkR_IqSZMnhxpjooqRdszWNJYeowBxyk_zpLSoay7DZlf_ONP2kfYmuf8iC4ePqCqGuReeVtBTVy-WoKMrfmTgoQfuvDkjZ6M8i4ZoQt6SZuUEa-qlFUYIrlEnzFvKKxXR8UeilD4WuRjONkVXG8lHdz2kP-2pwg169-MMr8bYk3cTbOlVRhqeKyp7ps9sbbXoAL7rtqT2s","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"META\n- SEO Title: MoonAgents MoonPay AI App Launched on June 3\n- Meta Description: MoonPay's new MoonAgents MoonPay AI desktop app lets users connect Claude and Codex to crypto wallets for trading and payments, storing keys locally for security.\n- URL Slug: moonpay-launches-moonagents-ai-desktop-app\n- Categories: Adoption, Latest News\n- Primary Keyword: MoonAgents MoonPay AI\n- Secondary Keywords: Claude, Codex, Crypto AI\n\n---\n\n# MoonAgents MoonPay AI App Arrives, Connecting Claude and Codex to Crypto Wallets\n\nThe new **MoonAgents MoonPay AI** desktop application launched on June 3, 2026, creating a powerful bridge between artificial intelligence and the blockchain. Crypto payments firm MoonPay released the graphical user interface (GUI) to allow AI assistants from Anthropic and OpenAI to directly interact with crypto wallets, decentralized exchanges, and other on-chain services. This release aims to empower a broader, less technical audience to leverage AI for sophisticated crypto operations. [The software simplifies workflows for everything from research to execution](https://decrypt.co/369746/moonpay-brings-crypto-transactions-claude-codex-moonagents).\n\n## What is the MoonAgents Desktop App?\n\nThe MoonAgents desktop app is a control center that allows users to harness the code-writing capabilities of AI models for blockchain interaction. It provides a visual front end that abstracts away complex configurations, allowing users to connect existing Claude or Codex accounts to perform tasks like token swaps and prediction markets. As MoonPay's Head of Agents, Kevin Arifin, explained, the goal is to enable individuals to perform deep analysis and interact with the blockchain in ways previously restricted to those who could write scripts.\n\n### From Command Line to User-Friendly Interface\n\n\n[43 more lines in file. Use offset=21 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780492736227}}
